格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"可以在DeepSeek Harness中，快捷配置和管理多台 Jenkins 服务器与 Token， 支持设置页配置、模型工具触发构建、工作区级「执行 Jenkins Job」入口。无硬编码路径、 全量 TypeScript、可发布到 npm / GitHub。界面文案中英双语（跟随主界面语言）。","id":"gh:1335777768","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-jenkins","slug":"jsoncode/dsh-jenkins","topics":["dsh-jenkins","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"可以在DeepSeek Harness中，快捷配置和管理多台 Jenkins 服务器与 Token， 支持设置页配置、模型工具触发构建、工作区级「执行 Jenkins Job」入口。无硬编码路径、 全"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"量 TypeScript、可发布到 npm / GitHub。界面文案中英双语（跟随主界面语言）。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-jenkins"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**dsh-jenkins** is a Jenkins management plugin built on the DeepSeek Harness (DSH)\nhost, centralizin"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"g multiple servers and jobs for fast build publishing."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"- **Multi-server / multi-job management** — configure and manage multiple Jenkins\nservers and jobs i"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"n one place\n- **One-click publishing** — trigger parameterized builds, track\nqueue → building → resu"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"lt in real time\n- **Logs & operations** — view build logs, stop or cancel builds at any time\n- **Bil"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"ingual UI** — follows the host interface language (中文 / English)"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Available from the Settings page, a per-workspace entry, and model tools."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"中文文档"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Screenshots of the Settings page, workspace entry and run/history modals: see preview.md."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Settings → Jenkins Config** page (`settings.section`): add / edit / delete\nmultiple servers (URL"},{"id":"p10s2","text":", username, Token), test connections, skip TLS verification.\nOnly **Server URL** and **Token** are r"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"equired (username defaults to `admin`).\n- **Project Config** (`$DSH_HOME/dsh-jenkins-map.json`): eve"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ry project's publish\ntargets in one file — project name → target array, with elements identical to a"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"\nworkspace config file (`{ name?, job, server, environments }`). Each env can carry a\n**`name` displ"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"ay label** (e.g. `uat环境` / `prod灰度` / `prod环境`) and the number of\nenvs is **unlimited** (an empty na"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"me falls back to UAT / Prod / Env N). A\n`dsh-jenkins.json/js/ts` in a project root is **discovered a"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"utomatically** (folder\nname as the project name, missing-only — nothing you edited is overwritten), "},{"id":"p10s9","text":"so\nthere is usually nothing to maintain by hand; to edit, click **Edit map** on the\nProject Config r"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"ow of the Config tab (form / JSON). See\nProject config.\n- **Workspace entry** (`sidebar.footer.actio"},{"id":"p10s11","text":"n`): a footer group with the **Jenkins\nlogo button** (opens the unified modal) and a **History butto"},{"id":"p10s12","text":"n** (clock icon,\npublish history of the last 50 runs across all workspaces, filterable by\nworkspace "},{"id":"p10s13","text":"— defaults to All).\nThe Publish tab has just three rows — **project → server → job** — then the\npara"},{"id":"p10s14","text":"meter form, build triggering and status polling (queued → building → result,\n10-minute timeout). **T"},{"id":"p10s15","text":"he env has no row of its own**: each env in a project\nconfig *is* a server, so env selection lives i"},{"id":"p10s16","text":"n the **Server** dropdown — whose\nlabels show **only the plugin's server name** (never a mix of the "},{"id":"p10s17","text":"config's env\nname and the server name), and picking one switches the job / params to that env.\nConfi"},{"id":"p10s18","text":"g `server` refs are matched against configured servers by\n**name → id → full URL → domain** (the dom"},{"id":"p10s19","text":"ain level ignores scheme, port and\ncontext path). The dropdown shows the **intersection of the serve"},{"id":"p10s20","text":"rs referenced by\nthe project config and the servers configured in the plugin**; the last\n**parameter"},{"id":"p10s21","text":"s** are remembered per project and auto-echoed next time.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Structure"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Workspace config file (`dsh-jenkins.json` / `.js` / `.ts`)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Place it in the **workspace root**. It is an **array**; each element is one deploy\ntarget (job + ser"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ver + environments params). `.json` is parsed directly; `.js` / `.ts`\nare evaluated with node (CJS `"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"module.exports` or ESM `export default`):"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- Every element requires `job` (Jenkins job path, e.g. `build-app` or\n`folder/build-app`) and `serve"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"r` (the server name / id / URL as configured in\nSettings → Jenkins).\n- `environments` (optional): th"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"e parameter map for this target (booleans render as\ncheckboxes, everything else as text fields).\n- S"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"uch a file is now a **discovery source**: the plugin reads it into\nProject Config under the **worksp"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"ace folder\nname** (missing-only — existing projects are never overwritten). Just pick the\nproject on"},{"id":"p16s6","text":" the Publish tab; server / job / params come from the current env."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Project config (`dsh-jenkins-map.json`)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"One config for every project: **project name → target array**. Each env may carry a\n**`name` display"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" label** (e.g. `uat环境` / `prod灰度` / `prod环境`) and the number of\nenvs is **unlimited** (env 1 is the "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"default, usually UAT); when the name is empty the\nUI falls back to `UAT` / `Prod` / `Env N`. Element"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"s are identical to a workspace config\nfile, so they can be moved back and forth:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **Where it lives**: its own file **`$DSH_HOME/dsh-jenkins-map.json`** (a bare map,\nno wrapper, pla"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"intext; a missing file loads as `{}`, a corrupt one is backed up to\n`.bak` and treated as empty). A "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"legacy `projects` field inside `dsh-jenkins.json`\nis migrated into this file on first startup (missi"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"ng-only).\n- **`name` (env display label)**: optional; an empty string is dropped (no\n`\"name\": \"\"` is"},{"id":"p20s5","text":" written). It shows up in the Server dropdown label and in Local\nRecords, so a build's env is obviou"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"s at a glance.\n- **Unlimited envs**: a project may have any number of targets (UAT / gray / prod /\no"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"verseas…); array order is display order and item 1 is the default.\n- **Discovery**: opening the Conf"},{"id":"p20s8","text":"ig / Publish tab scans every **open workspace root**\nfor `dsh-jenkins.json/js/ts` and merges it unde"},{"id":"p20s9","text":"r the **folder name** —\n**missing-only by default**, so hand-edited projects are never clobbered. To"},{"id":"p20s10","text":" pull\nin updated workspace configs, tick **Overwrite same-name projects** and hit\n**Rediscover** in "},{"id":"p20s11","text":"the modal footer.\n- **Editing**: on the Config tab, the **Project Config** row\n(`dsh-jenkins-map.jso"},{"id":"p20s12","text":"n · N projects`) → **Edit map**:\n- **Form**: project list; each env row is env name (optional, place"},{"id":"p20s13","text":"holder shows the\nfallback) + job + server + **N params** (expands that env's key/value editor,\nvalue"},{"id":"p20s14","text":"s text / number / boolean) + a per-row remove button; **Add env** has no cap,\nand projects / envs / "},{"id":"p20s15","text":"params can all be added or removed;\n- **JSON**: the whole map as JSON — paste your own config wholes"},{"id":"p20s16","text":"ale, then\n**Apply JSON** to write it back into the form.\n- **`server` refs** may be a server **name "},{"id":"p20s17","text":"/ id / full URL / bare domain**; they are\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> **Local development dependencies**: the host loads `index.js` through native Node ESM, so\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
